#CB010513-F PM counters for TC7
## The counter M55308C1005 (PRB available for PDSCH with L1 Basebnad pooling activated) value
## Cell 1 : zab cell, BBRM allocats 273 PRB due to inter subpool pooling
##  - 12 SSB slots :   273-32=241 PRB (32 PRB for SSB, others for PDSCH)
##  - 12 SIB 1 Slots :  273 pdsch PRB per slot
##  - 16 Specific slots :  0 pdsch PRB
##  - 32 RA+UL slots : 0 pdsch PRB
##  - 32 muted slots : 0 pdsch (slot 3 & 13 due to 2516(16 slots), slot 6 & 16 due to canada frame struct(16slots))
##  - 56 Full DL slots : 273 PRB
##               in every 160slots : 12*241+12*273+56*273=21456
##               in 5 mins :  21456*(600000/160)=80460000
##   update in FB2402 - PR03497201 a fix for Apple UE using PwrSaving BWP, slot 6 & 16 are no more muted
##         72 full DL slots of 273 PRB
##               in every 160slots : 12*241+12*273+72*273=25824
##               in 5 mins : 25824*(600000/160)=96840000
##
## Cell 2 : non zab cell, BBRM allocates 54 PRB due to inter subpool pooling
##  - 12 SSB slots :   54-20=34 PRB (20 PRB for SSB, others for PDSCH)
##  - 12 SIB 1 Slots :  54 pdsch PRB per slot
##  - 16 Specific slots :  0 pdsch PRB
##  - 32 RA+UL slots : 0 pdsch PRB
##  - 44 muted slots : 0 pdsch (slot 3 & 13 due to 2516(16 slots) slot 6 & 16 due to canada frame struct(16slots),
##     slot 0,1,2 of odd SFN (12slots) due to pooling, CRS TRS/ACQ slots of other pooling groups are not allowed
##     to transmit pdsch if not zab cell   )
##  - 44 Full DL slots : 54 PRB
##               in every 160slots :  12*(54-20)+12*54+44*54=3432
##               in 5mins ;   3432*(600000/160)=12780000
##   update in FB2402 - PR03497201 a fix for Apple UE using PwrSaving BWP, slot 6 & 16 are no more muted
##          60 full DL slots of 54 PRB
##               in every 160slots : 12*(54-20)+12*54+60*54=4296
##               in 5mins ; 4296*(600000/160)=16110000
##
## Cell 3 : non zab cell, BBRM allocates 273 PRB due to inter sub
##  - 12 SSB slots :   273-32=241 PRB (32 PRB for SSB, others for PDSCH)
##  - 12 SIB 1 Slots :  273 pdsch PRB per slot
##  - 16 Specific slots :  0 pdsch PRB
##  - 32 RA+UL slots : 0 pdsch PRB
##  - 44 muted slots : 0 pdsch (slot 3 & 13 due to 2516(16 slots) slot 6 & 16 due to canada frame struct(16slots),
##     slot 0,1,2 of odd SFN (12slots) due to pooling, CRS TRS/ACQ slots of other pooling groups are not allowed
##     to transmit pdsch if not zab cell   )
##  - 44 Full DL slots : 273 PRB
##               in every 160slots :  12*241+12*273+44*273=18180
##               in 5mins :   18180*(600000/160)=68175000
##   update in FB2402 - PR03497201 a fix for Apple UE using PwrSaving BWP, slot 6 & 16 are no more muted
##        60 full DL slots of 273 PRB
##               in every 160slots :  12*241+12*273+60*273=22548
##               in 5mins : 22548*(600000/160)=84555000
##
##
## The counter M55308C1006 (PRB available for PUSCH with L1 Basebnad pooling activated) value
## With 2516 BiAgreement, no muted UL slots, all UL slots #8, #18, #9, #19 are all allowed for UL pusch;
##  -  32 UL+RACH Slots in total (26 UL, 6 RACH slots ) (6SSB config)
##     in UL slots without Rach, there will be 2*21=42 PRB for pucch; 273-42=231 for pusch
##     in RACH slots, threre will be 4 PRBs for guard, 12 PRB for RACH, so 231-4-12=215 PRB for pusch
##
##     in every 160slots :   26*231+215*6=7296 PRBs pusch
##     in every 5 mins :     7296*(600000/160)=27360000
##
##
##
##

&{CB010513_F_BB_POOL_DL_Counter_Expected}      PM_ID=M55308C10005
...                                     CELL_1_Expected=80460000
...                                     CELL_2_Expected=12870000
...                                     CELL_3_Expected=68175000

&{CB010513_F_BB_POOL_UL_Counter_Expected}      PM_ID=M55308C10006
...                                     CELL_1_Expected=27360000
...                                     CELL_2_Expected=27360000
...                                     CELL_3_Expected=27360000


*** Keywords ***

TC CB010513-F-TC-7
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     8940-I & G activated
    ...     Actions:        Cell setup & call setup with 3 UEs (UE 1 1200mbps, UE 2 10mbps, UE 3 175mbps)
    ...     Checks:         Zab privilege check : Cell 1 zab privileged=1, Cell 2 & 3 zab privileged=0;
    ...                     PM counters check : value as expected
    ...     Verdict:        Zab privilege check & PM counters value check as expected
    [Arguments]             ${param}
    ...                     ${vendor_custom}
    Init Sequence           ${param}
    # Step                    Set RAD Params Of CB010513 F
    Step                    Deploy Vendor File Config               vendor_param=${vendor_custom}        is_perform_full_commissioning=${false}
    Dated Log New Line      ${vendor_custom}
    Critical Step           Perform Recommissionning CB010513 F
    Critical Step           Restart TL
    Step                    Multi Cells Setup CB010513 F                argument=${param.nbCell}
    Step                    SA Call DL UL Traffic With UE Profile      argument=${Profile_UE_1}
    Step                    sleep    2s
    Step                    SA Call DL UL Traffic With UE Profile      argument=${Profile_UE_2}
    Step                    sleep    2s
    Step                    SA Call DL UL Traffic With UE Profile      argument=${Profile_UE_3}
    Step                    sleep    2s
    # Step                    Activate Sherpa On All Cells
    # Step                    sleep    10s
    # Step                    Stop Sherpa Collection
    Step                    Collect TTI Traces
    Step                    Post processing TTI Traces
    # Step                    Verify ZAB Privilege cells
    Step                    sleep    720s
    Step                    Collect Lastest PM Counters File
    Step                    Check CB010513 F PM Counters With Constraints   argument=${F_TC7_constraints}

